Nuvio Plus IPTV core (the iptvcore folder)

Copyright (c) 2026 wood29. All rights reserved.

This folder was written from scratch for Nuvio Plus. It contains no code from Nuvio,
NuvioMobile, NuvioTV or any other GPL-licensed project, and it does not depend on them.
It is not covered by the GPL licence of the rest of this repository and may be used by
its owner in other apps, including paid ones.

Video playback on Apple devices uses mpv and FFmpeg (LGPL). Apps that ship them must
publish the LGPL notices and the matching mpv/FFmpeg sources or relinking files.
